      "comments": [
        {
          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-21T13:42:53Z",
          "note": "Rework fix is clean and minimal — the catch block in writeModels() lines 213–223 precisely mirrors the established pattern in loadDefaults() (line 372–376). The condition `!(err instanceof ApiError && err.code === 'READ_ERROR') && !(isNodeError(err) && err.code === 'ENOENT')` is correct and exhaustive for the intent."
        },
        {
          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "low",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-21T13:42:53Z",
